Wolfram wrote:
> My question is this:  is there any way to get the protection back,
> besides finding a 3rd temple and buying it back?

There are at least three ways of getting intrinsic protection:
1 - donate to a priest.
2 - praying at an altar (when eligible to pray) can sometimes score a
point or two of protection direct from your god.
3 - eating a ring of protection has a(bout one third) chance of
conferring that protection as an intrinsic. Of course, protection rings
aren't always edible.

It sounds like 1 is no longer an option. 2 requires access to lots and
lots of sac-material to get any really worthwhile quantity of AC, but
is probably your best bet. Due to the low odds and low number of
suitable rings typically generated, 3 is unlikely to get you more than
a handful of points in any one game.

-4 is definitely a low AC for your current point in the game, but there
are ways of bringing it down to a decent level that dont' require
acquiring intrinsic protection.

BTW, respect for resisting the urge to spoil on your current level.
Good luck with that.


